    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i just look at his side of the bed and i think... maybe i was meant to be with him. like maybe this isn't just grief, maybe it's just me being in the wrong place. everything is so much better when i'm thinking about being with him again. it's the only time i don't feel this crushing weight.",
